<title>USA: Ceridian acquires Employee Assistance.</title>
<headline>Ceridian acquires Employee Assistance.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceridian Corp said Thursday it acquired Employee Assistance Associates Inc, a Michigan-based provider of employee assistance programs.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Employee Assistance has about 50 employees and had revenue of approximately $4 million in 1995. It provides employee assistance services, training programs for employees and managers on workplace issues.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
